  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* fix: rebase association globs above the config directory instead of dropping them\r\n* fix: don't let plugin associations move the file walk outside the config directory\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|b868e1e87d2ed23217e5ea9521989c167ce8392090088bf0e1fb43be727ea752|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|94b48820945602fb113a34343db0a9e653a8346c60966f790556dc9ce4084a92|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|3beb87a2582f1e43a301efd0840565518484e53f8c7b0ad27b857eee08e0745f|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|b9786b2a4ed1344040e8761f6eddd06124e19bbe6b4531b72cfaf7643dc08cbe|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|a6bfe3d9146634d73fbc43d827c8793a1e09fff4e7c4ce4992048f31767499b1|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|f71cb7e22d6776439eba168d5cb296092d6413fea7148fe4d70684a2702a4fee|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|f105dbc2b0bc0d83c644fcabc3e7bd8779469c0d9faeda48365c58b389d5a443|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|c820bfc67b0cd6f5f0fa4d00ecdcb056944c86030859f5e50151c88d9164b30d|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|61c8936368ff4030a615ce43853adc5a0707ff77973743d0a691aee2cbf64723|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|2a91437a5d61d6a47f0f58669238dcb35e765a36cdba71997eff179802c5090b|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-musl.zip|a4b109fed988b73b4416221b698e08444333b97d2b0de673e15e5cc9331063bf|\r\n|dprint-s390x-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|2d491ad3d9004e4cfdf6d90aa